---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;

const contactMethods = [
  {
    title: 'LinkedIn',
    value: 'Connect with me',
    href: 'https://linkedin.com/in/chandrima-ganguly',
    icon: `<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M16 8a6 6 0 016 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 00-2-2 2 2 0 00-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 016-6zM2 9h4v12H2z"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2" stroke-width="1.5"/>`,
    external: true,
  },
  {
    title: 'Substack',
    value: 'Read my newsletter',
    href: 'https://chandrimaganguly.substack.com/s/when-is-ai-responsible',
    icon: `<path d="M22.539 8.242H1.46V5.406h21.08v2.836zM1.46 10.812V24L12 18.11 22.54 24V10.812H1.46zM22.54 0H1.46v2.836h21.08V0z"/>`,
    external: true,
    fill: true,
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Book a 30-minute call with Chandrima Ganguly, Fractional AI Architect & Enablement Lead."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-gradient-to-b from-warm-stone/50 to-soft-cream">
    <div class="container-wide mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-terracotta text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Contact</p>
        <h1 class="mb-6">Let's work out if we're a fit.</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-deep-earth/80 leading-relaxed">
          Book a 30-minute call. I'll ask what you're building, you'll ask what I can do, and we'll both know by the end whether it makes sense to work together. No pitch. No commitment. Just clarity.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Contact Section -->
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-wide mx-auto">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
        <!-- Left Column: Info + Calendar -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl mb-6">Book a call</h2>
          <p class="text-deep-earth/70 mb-8">
            Choose the session type that works best for you. If you're not sure, start with the 30-minute discovery call.
          </p>

          <!-- Booking Options -->
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-12">
            <!-- 15-minute Introduction -->
            <a
              href="https://app.cal.eu/z0l18qy88-mozmail.com/15min"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border-2 border-morning-gold/30 hover:border-morning-gold transition-colors group"
            >
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
                <div class="flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-forest-deep text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-morning-gold transition-colors">
                    Introduction
                  </h3>
                  <p class="text-deep-earth/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Brief introductory call. Tell me what you're building; I'll tell you if I can help.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-morning-gold/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center ml-4 flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-morning-gold/20 transition-colors">
                  <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-forest-deep" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-deep-earth/60">
                  <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                    </svg>
                    15 minutes
                  </span>
                  <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 10l4.553-2.276A1 1 0 0121 8.618v6.764a1 1 0 01-1.447.894L15 14M5 18h8a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
                    </svg>
                    Video call
                  </span>
                </div>
                <span class="font-semibold text-sage text-lg">Free</span>
              </div>
            </a>

            <!-- 30-minute Discovery -->
            <a
              href="https://app.cal.eu/z0l18qy88-mozmail.com/30min"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border-2 border-sage/30 hover:border-sage transition-colors group"
            >
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
                <div class="flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-forest-deep text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-sage transition-colors">
                    Discovery
                  </h3>
                  <p class="text-deep-earth/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    We go deeper: what you're building, where the safety or eval gaps are, and what an engagement would look like.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-sage/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center ml-4 flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-sage/20 transition-colors">
                  <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-forest-deep" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-deep-earth/60">
                  <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                    </svg>
                    30 minutes
                  </span>
                  <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 10l4.553-2.276A1 1 0 0121 8.618v6.764a1 1 0 01-1.447.894L15 14M5 18h8a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
                    </svg>
                    Video call
                  </span>
                </div>
                <span class="font-semibold text-sage text-lg">£100</span>
              </div>
            </a>

            <!-- 60-minute Strategy -->
            <a
              href="https://app.cal.eu/z0l18qy88-mozmail.com/60min"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border-2 border-terracotta/30 hover:border-terracotta transition-colors group"
            >
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
                <div class="flex-1">
                  <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-forest-deep text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-terracotta transition-colors">
                    Technical Deep-Dive
                  </h3>
                  <p class="text-deep-earth/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    In-depth technical session: we look at your system architecture, eval approach, and safety gaps in detail.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-terracotta/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center ml-4 flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-terracotta/20 transition-colors">
                  <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-forest-deep" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-deep-earth/60">
                  <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                    </svg>
                    60 minutes
                  </span>
                  <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 10l4.553-2.276A1 1 0 0121 8.618v6.764a1 1 0 01-1.447.894L15 14M5 18h8a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
                    </svg>
                    Video call
                  </span>
                </div>
                <span class="font-semibold text-terracotta text-lg">£200</span>
              </div>
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Contact Methods -->
          <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-forest-deep mb-4">Other ways to reach me</h3>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            {contactMethods.map((method) => (
              <a
                href={method.href}
                target={method.external ? '_blank' : undefined}
                rel={method.external ? 'noopener noreferrer' : undefined}
                class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-warm-stone hover:border-sage/50 transition-colors group"
              >
                <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-sage/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-sage/20 transition-colors">
                  <svg
                    class="w-5 h-5 text-forest-deep"
                    fill={method.fill ? 'currentColor' : 'none'}
                    stroke={method.fill ? 'none' : 'currentColor'}
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    set:html={method.icon}
                  />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-medium text-forest-deep">{method.title}</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-deep-earth/60">{method.value}</p>
                </div>
                {method.external && (
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-sage ml-auto" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/>
                  </svg>
                )}
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Contact Form -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl mb-6">Send a message</h2>
          <p class="text-deep-earth/70 mb-8">
            Prefer to write first? Tell me briefly what you're building and what the safety or eval challenge is. I'll respond within 2 business days.
          </p>

          <form
            action="https://formspree.io/f/xnjjdbev"
            method="POST"
            class="space-y-6"
          >
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div>
                <label for="name" class="block text-sm font-medium text-forest-deep mb-2">
                  Name *
                </label>
                <input
                  type="text"
                  id="name"
                  name="name"
                  required
                  class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-warm-stone bg-white focus:border-sage focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sage/20 outline-none transition-colors"
                  placeholder="Your name"
                />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-medium text-forest-deep mb-2">
                  Email *
                </label>
                <input
                  type="email"
                  id="email"
                  name="email"
                  required
                  class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-warm-stone bg-white focus:border-sage focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sage/20 outline-none transition-colors"
                  placeholder="Best email to reach you"
                />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label for="organization" class="block text-sm font-medium text-forest-deep mb-2">
                Company / project
              </label>
              <input
                type="text"
                id="organization"
                name="organization"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-warm-stone bg-white focus:border-sage focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sage/20 outline-none transition-colors"
                placeholder="Company or project name"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label for="role" class="block text-sm font-medium text-forest-deep mb-2">
                Your role
              </label>
              <input
                type="text"
                id="role"
                name="role"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-warm-stone bg-white focus:border-sage focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sage/20 outline-none transition-colors"
                placeholder="e.g. CTO, Head of AI, Founder"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label for="interest" class="block text-sm font-medium text-forest-deep mb-2">
                What are you working on?
              </label>
              <select
                id="interest"
                name="interest"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-warm-stone bg-white focus:border-sage focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sage/20 outline-none transition-colors"
              >
                <option value="">Select an option</option>
                <option value="fractional">Fractional AI Architect (ongoing)</option>
                <option value="guardrails">Guardrails Design &amp; Build</option>
                <option value="enablement">AI Enablement Sprint</option>
                <option value="agentic">Agentic Systems Architecture</option>
                <option value="eu-ai-act">EU AI Act Readiness</option>
                <option value="advisory">Responsible AI Advisory</option>
                <option value="speaking">Speaking Engagement</option>
                <option value="other">Other</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label for="message" class="block text-sm font-medium text-forest-deep mb-2">
                Message *
              </label>
              <textarea
                id="message"
                name="message"
                required
                rows="5"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-warm-stone bg-white focus:border-sage focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sage/20 outline-none transition-colors resize-none"
                placeholder="Tell me briefly: what are you building, and what's the safety or eval challenge you're facing?"
              ></textarea>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label for="how_found" class="block text-sm font-medium text-forest-deep mb-2">
                How did you find me?
              </label>
              <select
                id="how_found"
                name="how_found"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-warm-stone bg-white focus:border-sage focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sage/20 outline-none transition-colors"
              >
                <option value="">Select an option</option>
                <option value="search">Search engine</option>
                <option value="linkedin">LinkedIn</option>
                <option value="substack">Substack newsletter</option>
                <option value="referral">Referral</option>
                <option value="event">Event or conference</option>
                <option value="other">Other</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto">
              Send Message
            </button>

            <p class="text-xs text-deep-earth/50">
              By submitting this form, you agree to receive a response from me via email.
              I respect your privacy and won't share your information.
            </p>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Section -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-warm-stone/30">
    <div class="container-narrow mx-auto">
      <SectionHeader
        label="FAQ"
        title="Common Questions"
      />

      <div class="mt-12 space-y-6">
        <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-heading font-semibold text-forest-deep">
            Which call type should I book?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sage group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="mt-4 text-deep-earth/70 leading-relaxed space-y-3">
            <p>
              <strong class="text-forest-deep">Introduction (15 minutes, free):</strong> If you're not sure whether we're a fit, start here. Tell me what you're building; I'll tell you if I can help.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-forest-deep">Discovery (30 minutes — £100):</strong> We go deeper: your system architecture, where the safety or eval gaps are, and what an engagement would look like.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-forest-deep">Technical Deep-Dive (60 minutes — £200):</strong> We look at your system in detail. Right if you want a technical assessment or want to scope a specific engagement before committing.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-heading font-semibold text-forest-deep">
            How quickly do you respond?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sage group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-deep-earth/70 leading-relaxed">
            Within 2 business days for messages. If you have an urgent need — a production incident, an imminent regulatory deadline — mention it and I'll prioritise accordingly.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-heading font-semibold text-forest-deep">
            What stage does a company need to be at?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sage group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-deep-earth/70 leading-relaxed">
            I work primarily with startups and scale-ups (Series A–D) that are actively building with LLMs in production or close to it. The right time to talk is when you're building something real that needs safety infrastructure — not when you're pre-product.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-heading font-semibold text-forest-deep">
            Are you available for speaking engagements?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sage group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-deep-earth/70 leading-relaxed">
            Yes. I speak on building production AI safely, agentic architecture, evals at scale, and what actually happens when safety is an afterthought. Select "Speaking Engagement" in the form above and tell me about your event.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  // Cal.com embed script (add to page when Cal.com is configured)
  // <script type="module" src="https://app.cal.com/embed/embed.js"><\/script>
</script>
